# This repo is a self-contained PUBLISHABLE BUILD (editor export artifact).
# The ignore list below is a guard rail: content a dev tree can contain is
# rejected here, so a re-publish can never leak it. Source of truth for the
# game's source, tests and tools is the private repo (KelpME/scorched-earth).

# --- dev-tree content that must never appear here ---
test/
tools/
.hermes/
.hermesforge-export.json

# --- dependencies & build intermediates ---
node_modules/
.vite/
build/
dist/

# --- test / report artifacts ---
test-results/
playwright-report/

# --- OS / editor / logs ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
*.tmp
